        <p class="card__body">A mood-tracking app concept built on Plutchik's wheel of emotions. My UT Dallas capstone.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/work/via/">
        <p class="card__eyebrow eyebrow-wide">2020 · Civic tech</p>
        <p class="card__title">Via</p>
        <p class="card__body">If the security problem were solved, what would voting from your phone have to feel like?</p>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/work/port-of-peri-peri/">
        <p class="card__eyebrow eyebrow-wide">Restaurant · Ordering flow</p>
        <p class="card__title">Port of Peri Peri</p>
        <p class="card__body">Fixing a restaurant's ordering funnel from behind the counter, where I could watch every order get stuck.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

